  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s Integrated Sexual Health WISH 2 (Zambia uplift 2025-26)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This funding will support foundational investments in the WISH 2 project and contribute towards ensuring women and girls have reliable access to the Sexual Reproductive Health information, services and commodities they need, when and where they need them. This project will close critical gaps in family planning and SRHR services, support the Ministry of Health to address commodity shortfalls, and contribute to Zambia&#x2019;s FP2030 commitments. The investment will prioritise securing essential SRHR commodities, strengthening logistics and outreach, equipping facilities to better serve adolescents and young people, and building the skills of providers and peer educators. It will also be used to pilot safeguarding measures to protect client rights, support key partnerships, reinforce public financial management for transparency and accountability, and cover programme management. Together, these investments will strengthen health systems, enhance transparency, and contribute to efforts for sustainable impact.</narrative>
  </description>
